t as they create dishes they hope will strike a chord with everyone.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-24\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Camper Van\",\"overview\":\"There never seems to be much down-time at that sumptuous French château for owners Dick and Angel Strawbridge. Even as the summer ends after their busiest ever season and the last wedding of the year is nearly over, there’s still a lot to do. While most people would put up their feet and have a Pernod, Dick and Angel welcome an armada of vintage Citroëns that call in at the castle for a rest and breakfast during a fund-raising charity tour of France. And the family, including youngsters Arthur and Dorothy, work on their latest project, doing up a 1980s Asquith bus.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-12-01\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Autumn Renovation\",\"overview\":\"As the beginning of autumn arrives, Dick Strawbridge passes on his conker skills to the family, before the serious business resumes and the next phase of the renovation begins. Dick and his wife Angel Adoree get to work converting the old tack room into a grand entrance way. Angel knocks down walls and upcycles an old glass door, while Dick lays a new concrete floor.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-12-08\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Riverboat\",\"overview\":\"As autumn arrives at the chateau, Dick and Angel start a new project, turning a 35-foot eight-tonne riverboat into luxury guest accommodation, with bespoke fabrics and decking.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-12-15\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Escape to the Chateau at Christmas\",\"overview\":\"After another busy year, Dick and Angel prepare for Christmas with an exquisite festive menu; some beautiful Christmas crafts; friends, family, and some special guests.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0